      en: ["Jilib is the most populous city in the Middle Juba administrative region.", "The town is located approximately 110 kilometers north of the port of Kismayo.", "It serves as a critical junction for the Mogadishu-Kismayo highway.", "The area is a primary producer of sesame and maize for the national market.", "Jilib's proximity to the Jubba River facilitates extensive irrigation projects.", "The town has historically been a major center for the Somali livestock trade."],
